module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.admitted_module_without_judged_standing

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data admitted_module_without_judged_standing: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "admitted_module_without_judged_standing" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**a source-ingested module has no judged standing** (the required gates adjudicate entry-derived closures, while source-root ingest admits a larger identity population; a module outside every required closure can carry a structurally checkable defect while every gate stays green. ",

    "This is NOT an import-edge class: globally unique names can resolve without a direct import, so authored inbound imports neither prove nor disprove judgment. ",

    "It is also NOT a claim that every identity outside the closures is defective or should be gated. ",

    "The severity is unknown, and that unknowability is the finding. ",

    "**SPECIMEN AND DISCRIMINATING CONTROL** (node://adhoc-2d3c27b7-660, PR #9899): gunbc.annotation_parse_instrument_agreement constructed Terminal { reason, authority } although Terminal declares only reason; a clean required run left both build and witnesses green and both in-run judgment receipts omitted the module. ",

    "The matched visible control placed the same undeclared-field construction in ordinary production module gunbc.clock_read: both required lanes refused with `field 'authority' not found in type 'LaneVisibilityControl'`; removing only the plant returned both lanes to green. ",

    "Thus visibility, with defect class held constant, discriminates the arms. ",

    "The witnesses prediction was weaker than its result: only submitted-closure membership was known beforehand, yet execution established strict judgment by refusing. ",

    "**MEASUREMENT, EXPLICITLY NOT COVERAGE OR ENFORCEMENT:** the producer joins every first-party identity admitted by the exact source-root ingest against the union of module identities for which build or witnesses produced a strict typecheck verdict. ",

    "On clean run 33484666539 it derived 4,419 admitted, 947 build-judged, 2,158 witnesses-judged, 2,319 in the judgment union, and 2,100 with no required-lane judgment. ",

    "Build contributes only 161 identities beyond witnesses, so the two required closures are far from independent and their union remains close to one lane's reach. ",

    "Exactly one of the 2,100 is confirmed orphaned by the executed control; the other 2,099 are Undecided because no typed authority currently says whether each is an executing standalone entry, fixture/generated/excluded, retired, or orphaned. ",

    "Those identities are deliberately re-derived and NOT committed as a baseline or roster: a hand-carried 2,099-row exemption set would be a ratchet wearing a wall's name. ",

    "The instrument reports; it does not refuse, and citing it as a gate is rung inflation. ",

    "**PROVENANCE LIMIT:** in-run strict judgments and cross-process content-addressed cache judgments are separate columns. ",

    "Required CI does not arm GUNBC_RESOLVED_GRAPH_CACHE_DIR, so the cross-process column was empty beside nonempty in-run columns in both planted and reverted runs. ",

    "That empty column is a control for the unarmed premise, NOT evidence that the provenance split is exercised by required CI. ",

    "**CEILING: decidable but waiting on a single standing authority.** A wall now would either false-red legitimate importer-free subjects or grandfather opaque debt. ",

    "The next rung requires four capabilities together: (1) one typed standing registry exhaustively binds every first-party ingest identity to required judgment, a verified executing consumer, typed fixture/generated/exclusion, retirement, or orphan standing; (2) each executing-consumer binding is checked against the named consumer's actual roster and execution receipt, so a hollow alias cannot admit it; (3) a changed retained identity resolves only through its named consumer from materialized facts within the required floor's 8-second wall and 500-millisecond CPU envelopes, never by whole-corpus compilation; and (4) the two-direction matched undeclared-field control remains executable. ",

    "At that rung admission makes the invalid state unwritable; until then this remains measurement and an Undecided population, not a defect backlog.)",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
